
---
const title = "Terms & Conditions | Bezels";
const description =
  "Read the terms and conditions for using the Bezels anime discovery website and its tools.";
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <meta name="description" content={description} />
    <title>{title}</title>

    <style>
      * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

      body {
        background: #090d18;
        color: #f4f6ff;
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        min-height: 100vh;
      }

      header {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        padding: 22px 8%;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #20283b;
      }

      .logo {
        color: white;
        font-size: 27px;
        font-weight: 800;
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      .logo span { color: #8b7cff; }

      nav {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 20px;
      }

      nav a {
        color: #b9bfd1;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-size: 14px;
      }

      nav a:hover { color: #a99aff; }

      main {
        max-width: 850px;
        margin: auto;
        padding: 70px 22px 90px;
      }

      .eyebrow {
        color: #a99aff;
        font-size: 12px;
        letter-spacing: 2px;
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: clamp(36px, 6vw, 52px);
        margin: 18px 0;
      }

      h1 span { color: #9685ff; }

      .updated {
        color: #828da5;
        font-size: 13px;
        margin-bottom: 30px;
      }

      .intro {
        color: #b9bfd1;
        font-size: 16px;
        line-height: 1.9;
        margin-bottom: 35px;
      }

      .terms-section { margin-top: 30px; }

      .terms-section h2 {
        font-size: 21px;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
      }

      .terms-section p,
      .terms-section li {
        color: #aab2c6;
        font-size: 14px;
        line-height: 1.9;
      }

      .terms-section ul {
        margin: 12px 0 0 22px;
      }

      .terms-section a {
        color: #b9aaff;
        overflow-wrap: anywhere;
      }

      footer {
        text-align: center;
        border-top: 1px solid #20283b;
        padding: 28px 20px;
        color: #828da5;
        font-size: 13px;
      }

      footer a {
        color: #a99aff;
        text-decoration: none;
        margin: 0 8px;
      }

      @media (max-width: 650px) {
        header {
          padding: 20px;
          flex-direction: column;
          gap: 18px;
        }

        nav {
          justify-content: center;
          gap: 13px;
        }

        nav a { font-size: 12px; }
      }
    </style>
  </head>

  <body>
    <header>
      <a class="logo" href="/">BEZELS<span>.</span></a>

      <nav>
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <a href="/find-anime/">Find Anime</a>
        <a href="/anime-quiz/">Anime Quiz</a>
        <a href="/watchlist/">My Watchlist</a>
        <a href="/articles/">Articles</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <span class="eyebrow">WEBSITE GUIDELINES</span>

      <h1>Terms & <span>Conditions.</span></h1>

      <p class="updated">Last updated: November 7, 2026</p>

      <p class="intro">
        Welcome to Bezels. These Terms & Conditions explain
        the general rules for accessing and using our website.
        By visiting or using Bezels, you agree to follow these
        terms. If you do not agree, please discontinue using
        the website.
      </p>

      <section class="terms-section">
        <h2>1. About Bezels</h2>
        <p>
          Bezels is an anime discovery platform that provides
          recommendation tools, a browser-based watchlist and
          anime-related articles. Features and content may
          change as the website develops.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="terms-section">
        <h2>2. Acceptable Use</h2>
        <p>
          You agree to use Bezels responsibly and lawfully.
          You must not:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>Attempt to damage or disrupt the website.</li>
          <li>Attempt unauthorised access to website systems.</li>
          <li>Use the website for unlawful or harmful activities.</li>
          <li>Copy or republish website content without permission.</li>
          <li>Interfere with other visitors' use of the website.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="terms-section">
        <h2>3. Anime Recommendations</h2>
        <p>
          Our recommendation tools use preferences selected by
          visitors and information in our anime database.
          Recommendations are suggestions only. Match scores
          do not guarantee that a particular anime will suit
          every visitor's personal taste.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="terms-section">
        <h2>4. Watchlist and Browser Storage</h2>
        <p>
          The watchlist feature may store saved anime and
          watched-status information in your browser's local
          storage. This information is associated with the
          browser and device being used. It may be lost if
          browser data is cleared and is not guaranteed to
          synchronise across devices.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="terms-section">
        <h2>5. Website Content and Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p>
          Original text, website design, branding and tools
          created for Bezels belong to their respective owners
          unless otherwise stated. You may not reproduce,
          distribute or commercially use original Bezels
          content without appropriate permission.
        </p>
        <p style="margin-top: 12px;">
          Anime titles, characters, logos and related materials
          may belong to their respective copyright and trademark
          owners. Bezels does not claim ownership of third-party
          intellectual property.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="terms-section">
        <h2>6. Third-Party Websites</h2>
        <p>
          Bezels may link to external websites for additional
          information or services. We do not control those
          websites and are not responsible for their content,
          availability or policies.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="terms-section">
        <h2>7. Website Availability</h2>
        <p>
          We aim to keep Bezels available and functional, but
          uninterrupted access cannot be guaranteed. Features
          may occasionally be updated, changed, suspended or
          discontinued.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="terms-section">
        <h2>8. Limitation of Responsibility</h2>
        <p>
          Bezels is provided for general informational and
          entertainment purposes. To the extent permitted by
          applicable law, we do not guarantee that all website
          information will always be complete, accurate or
          available. Nothing in these terms excludes rights
          that cannot legally be excluded.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="terms-section">
        <h2>9. Changes to These Terms</h2>
        <p>
          We may revise these Terms & Conditions as the website
          and its features change. Updated terms will be
          published on this page with a revised date.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="terms-section">
        <h2>10. Contact</h2>
        <p>
          For questions about these terms, contact us at
          <a href="mailto:mbilalvxl@gmail.com">mbilalvxl@gmail.com</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <p>© 2026 Bezels. Made for anime fans.</p>
      <p style="margin-top: 12px;">
        <a href="/about/">About</a>
        <a href="/contact/">Contact</a>
        <a href="/privacy-policy/">Privacy Policy</a>
      </p>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
